flowchart LR
  User[User] -->|Upload CSV| API[FastAPI API]
  API -->|Enqueue job| Redis[Redis broker]
  API -->|Read/write| Postgres[PostgreSQL]
  Worker[Celery worker] -->|Consume job| Redis
